  "details": "I myself have seen this game become something that is very fun to play and ive put many thousands of hours into their game. But im saying this now adding EAC isnt a good way to go about fixing their game\n1. Talk to some mod creators and MAKE OFFICIAL PARTNERED MODS for quality of life. \n2. Some  of the DEVS USE clients for quality of life i've met a few \n3. I use my own file for my motion capture suit to work in VRC as full body without that file I cannot use it properly and it will just kill the vibe of even playing VRC\n4. I dont agree with malicious mods I do agree tho with some quality of life ones like IKTweaks and Portable mirror addons and camera tweaks\nWith this all being said please if you truly care for your player base then you might wanna have some quality of life mods allowed to be used by the community, Thanks devs for the wonderful game that you have created but if you continue down this road you will most likely ruin the experience more than actual cheaters do for the community.",
